	<section_number>45.2-734</section_number>
	<catch_line> Unused openings</catch_line>
	<text>
		Every unused or abandoned surface opening shall be effectively closed or fenced against unauthorized entrance.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 45-71.1; 1954, c. 191; 1966, c. 594, § 45.1-95; 1984, c. 228; 1985, c. 395; 1990, c. 372; 1992, c. 360; 1994, c. 28, § 45.1-161.170; 1999, c. 256; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
